[[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2752733\">3330C34</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752965\">5530B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752967\">5530B56</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752966\">5530B52</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752486\">1048A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752731\">3330C14</a></p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection from the A.B.S. hydraulic\nand electronic control unit.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>ABS control unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>M50</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Unscrew the pipe connectors from  the hydraulic and electronic\ncontrol unit.</p><p>3. Unscrew the retaining nuts.</p><p>4. Remove the ABS hydraulic and electronic control unit.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2046700.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the A.B.S. hydraulic and\nelectronic control unit in its seat and tighten the nuts to the\nspecified torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Nut</p></td><td><p>HYDRAULIC AND ELECTRONIC CONTROL UNIT</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.8</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the pipes to the A.B.S. hydraulic\nand electronic control unit and tighten the connectors to the specified\ntorque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Connector</p></td><td><p>ABS CONTROL UNIT RIGID FRONT BRAKE PIPES../</p></td><td><p>M10</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1,6</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Connector</p></td><td><p>ABS CONTROL UNIT RIGID FRONT BRAKE PIPES../</p></td><td><p>M12</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.6</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the electrical connection to the\nA.B.S. hydraulic and electronic control unit.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>ABS control unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>M50</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2752731\">3330C14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752486\">1048A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752966\">5530B52</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752967\">5530B56</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752965\">5530B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752733\">3330C34</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752384\">0010T64</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752385\">0010T65</a></p>"]]